# ReadableHTML — server configuration
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in the values.

# --- Supabase (required) ---
# Supabase dashboard → Project Settings → API.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-public-key

# --- OpenAI (optional, server-only) ---
# Required ONLY for AI-structured study pages (the "Restructure with AI"
# button on a document). Without it, all documents fall back to heuristic
# structuring — uploads, reading, and annotations still work.
# Never prefix this with NEXT_PUBLIC — it must not be shipped to the browser.
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# --- Chandra (layout-aware OCR, optional, server-only) ---
# Powers the "Improve layout with Chandra beta" / "Run OCR with Chandra beta"
# buttons. When unset, those buttons surface "Chandra is not configured…" —
# the rest of the app (text extraction, AI structuring, annotations,
# Restructure) keeps working without it. Never prefix with NEXT_PUBLIC.
#
# The HTTP call is currently a documented stub in
# lib/documents/chandra-provider.ts:HttpChandraProvider.convertPdf — wire it
# up before flipping the keys on in production.
CHANDRA_API_KEY=
# Defaults to https://api.datalab.to/v1/chandra if unset — set to override.
CHANDRA_API_URL=
